  {
   "id": "explore-alternative-cannabinoids",
   "src": "bde-section-258-180",
   "heading": "Explore alternative cannabinoids",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "img",
     "src": "/assets/photos/ll/ladyl_iconography_brandmark.webp",
     "alt": "LadyL_Iconography_BrandMark",
     "orig": "https://ladyljerseycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LadyL_Iconography_BrandMark.webp",
     "w": 500,
     "h": 500
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "THC isn’t the only game in town. Cannabis contains a whole spectrum of compounds—called cannabinoids—that offer unique effects and benefits. Whether you’re looking for better sleep, more focus, or relief without the high, these lesser-known cannabinoids can help you fine-tune your experience."
    },
    {
     "type": "img",
     "src": "/assets/photos/ll/ladyl_iconography_cbd.webp",
     "alt": "LadyL_Iconography_CBD",
     "orig": "https://ladyljerseycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LadyL_Iconography_CBD.webp",
     "w": 1500,
     "h": 1500
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "<strong>CBD (Cannabidiol)</strong><br>A go-to for relaxation without the high. CBD can help ease anxiety, reduce inflammation, and support overall calm — perfect for daytime use or when you want to stay clear-headed."
    },
    {
     "type": "img",
     "src": "/assets/photos/ll/ladyl_iconography_cbn.webp",
     "alt": "LadyL_Iconography_CBN",
     "orig": "https://ladyljerseycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LadyL_Iconography_CBN.webp",
     "w": 1500,
     "h": 1500
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "<strong>CBN (Cannabinol)</strong><br>Commonly known as the “sleepy cannabinoid.” CBN may help you unwind and drift off naturally, making it a favorite for nighttime use and deep rest."
    },
    {
     "type": "img",
     "src": "/assets/photos/ll/ladyl_iconography_thcv.webp",
     "alt": "LadyL_Iconography_THCV",
     "orig": "https://ladyljerseycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LadyL_Iconography_THCV.webp",
     "w": 1500,
     "h": 1500
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "<strong>THCV (Tetrahydrocannabivarin)</strong><br>Sometimes called “the energy cannabinoid.” THCV is known for boosting focus, curbing appetite, and delivering a clear, uplifted experience — great for staying productive."
    },
    {
     "type": "img",
     "src": "/assets/photos/ll/ladyl_iconography_cbg.webp",
     "alt": "LadyL_Iconography_CBG",
     "orig": "https://ladyljerseycity.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LadyL_Iconography_CBG.webp",
     "w": 1500,
     "h": 1500
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "<strong>CBG (Cannabigerol)</strong><br>A lesser-known powerhouse that may help with mood, gut health, and mental clarity. CBG is non-intoxicating and often used for its balancing and soothing effects."
    }
   ],
   "headingLevel": 2
